! Proposed Definitions And Examples

!! Proposed Definition of ''mau''

;__mau__ (BAI):  Exceeded by. Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of zmadu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of zmadu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is exceeded by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords: exceeded by. less than.

!! Examples of ''mau'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''se mau''

;__se mau__ (BAI*):  More than. Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of zmadu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of zmadu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is more than the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''se mau'' Usage
''mi'a ca nelci le cmalu trene ne semau le sorprekarce''
We like the small train, more so than the bus.

''mi'a litru semau lo nu stali le zdani''
We travel more than we stay at home.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se maunai''

;__se maunai__ (BAI*):  not more than Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of zmadu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of zmadu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is (relative!)                not more than ...; usually a sumti modifier the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''se maunai'' Usage
None found. Constructed examples follow:

!! Proposed Definition of ''te mau''

;__te mau__ (BAI*):  More in property. Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of zmadu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of zmadu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is exceeding something in the property which is the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''te mau'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve mau''

;__ve mau__ (BAI*):  More by amount. Tags a sumti as fitting the 4th place of zmadu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 4th place of zmadu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is exceeding something by the amount which is the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
